From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:17:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 41/47] media: i2c: add OmniVision OV32B40 image sensor driver

One 2x2-binned mode, 3264x2448 RAW10 at 30 fps on four D-PHY lanes at
852 Mbps, from a 24 MHz XVCLK, with exposure, analogue gain, VBLANK and
a colour bar test pattern. XVCLK is only checked, never set.

The register settings come from the GPL-2.0 MediaTek imgsensor driver
for this sensor in the Motorola mtkcam kernel modules (mot_aito_ov32b);
its initialisation table matches the global table of the GPL-2.0
Rockchip ov32b40 driver.
---
 MAINTAINERS                 |    8 +
 drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig   |   10 +
 drivers/media/i2c/Makefile  |    1 +
 drivers/media/i2c/ov32b40.c | 1278 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 1297 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/ov32b40.c

